      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kedeshi, kati na mokili ya Galile, lokola engumba ya kokimela mpo na moto oyo atangami mobomi ; Amoti-Dori mpe Karitani, elongo na mabele na yango ; ezalaki bongo bingumba misato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
